cache_policies={'pinned_release':'release_id + query target/horizon/scope + projection version; immutable results. Cursor pins ranking and sort.','pinned_snapshot':'complete FeatureKey/bars.window range + scope + snapshot + adjustment; serve only READY window.','pinned_account_version':'account_id + account_version + valuation_snapshot_id + valuation policy; never share across accounts. Historical versions replay canonical account events or use an exact versioned projection; filtering mutable current positions by applied_sequence is not historical reconstruction.','pinned_actionability':'actionability_id + account_id + account_version + quote_snapshot_id + policy + cursor; no live reorder of frozen rank.','owner_version':'principal_id + resource ID + saved version; persistence is PG, not TTL cache.','optimistic_owner_command':'principal owner + request hash + idempotency key; expected_*_version CAS in one transaction; emit outbox.','idempotent_command':'principal/role + Idempotency-Key + request hash; reuse the same logical job on retries.','resumable_event_cursor':'opaque cursor includes stream epoch + scope + contiguous position; expired retention resets to current snapshot.','pointer_read':'read current slot generation once; subsequent calls pin release_id.','catalog_snapshot':'cursor binds catalog version/read timestamp and filters; no mutable latest pagination.','health_sample':'short sampled operational read, explicit updated times; no freshness guarantee from HTTP200.','immutable_plan_version':'(plan_id,plan_version)+principal/account scope; no inferred latest version.','experiment_version':'experiment_id + state/lease_epoch; completed artifact and metrics immutable.','league_version':'league_id/version + round state; completed rounds immutable.','model_run_binding':'model_run_id + policy version + input hash; successful stale result cannot publish.','job_run_version':'job_run_id + lease_epoch/attempt_count; heartbeat is not data freshness.','quote_snapshot_or_current':'instrument_id + quote_policy_version + exact quote_snapshot_id/live_quote_version; current resolves a snapshot once. Immutable canonical artifact facts and time-derived freshness are separate. quote_projection is only a rebuildable hot cache: verify pinned artifact/hash/row identity and coverage before serving. Never fall back to daily close as a live quote.'}
